## Example .envrc for local development
# This file documents how to provide `GITHUB_TOKEN` to the project when you
# do not use `gopass`/`gh` or want to override the automatic loading.

# Option 1: export from environment (temporary):
# export GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_xxx"

# Option 2: use direnv to load from a local file (not committed):
# echo 'export GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_xxx"' > .envrc.local
# (then add .envrc.local to .gitignore)

# Option 3: use gopass with a path you control and make sure the path matches
# the one used by the project's .envrc (default: github/token):
# gopass insert github/token
